            <ArticleTitle>Synthesis of cyclopent-2-enones from furans using a nebulizer-based continuous flow photoreactor.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>10151-10155</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7ob02557b</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A series of hydroxycyclopent-2-enones and methoxycyclopent-2-enones have been synthesized in a single operation from simple furan substrates using an innovative continuous flow nebulizer system (NebPhotOX). Photooxygenation of the furan substrates takes place in an aerosol within the NebPhotOX system.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
